{
"#synopsis"
:
[
{
"x claw status [--yaml]"
:
null
}
]
,
"--yaml"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"输出机器可读的 YAML 格式（与原 x claw status 行为一致）"
,
"en"
:
"Output machine-readable YAML (same as the legacy x claw status behavior)"
}
}
,
"#tip"
:
[
{
"cn"
:
"默认输出为人类友好的分块文本格式，包含 Overview / Heartbeat / IM Connections / Cron Jobs。\n需要机器可读数据时，使用 `x claw status --yaml`。\n"
,
"en"
:
"Defaults to a human-friendly block format with Overview / Heartbeat / IM Connections / Cron Jobs.\nUse `x claw status --yaml` for machine-readable output.\n"
}
]
,
"#tldr"
:
[
{
"cmd"
:
"x claw status"
,
"cn"
:
"场景: 快速检查网关服务是否运行，以及各 IM 连接和 Agent 状态"
,
"en"
:
"Scenario: Quickly check if the gateway is running and review IM connections and Agent status"
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"x claw status --yaml"
,
"cn"
:
"场景: 输出 YAML 格式供脚本解析"
,
"en"
:
"Scenario: Output YAML for script parsing"
}
]
}

